'''Ravenwood Keep''' is a ruined keep in [[Gilneas]] that formerly served as the ancestral home of [[House Ravenwood]]. It was destroyed at the beginning of the [[Gilnean civil war]] by royalist forces loyal to the Harlow regime. The restless ghosts of the fallen still haunt the ruin, consumed by bitterness.

